  "details": "Were in a group public and realized that info above users froze and could not show more or less. \n\nAs shown in the attached images. I could not get any more information on anyone but Legendaryfoop. When opening the menu the other nameplates did not expand. And foops didn't get smaller when closing my menu.\n\nAll of the people were there when I joined in.\n\nA bonus is that the user omegamart had a pill in the instance. But was not there. And had no nameplate. Could see them swapping avatars from time to time.",
